{
  "name": "weekly-emits-no-interval-and-no-wkst",
  "note": "Weekly emits neither INTERVAL nor WKST, so every week is in the set and the week's start day cannot matter. Sunday+Monday straddles every candidate week boundary, which is what would expose a client that defaulted WKST to Sunday.",
